<title>PORTUGAL: TENNIS-ESTORIL OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ESTORIL OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ESTORIL, Portugal 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in</p>
<p>the $625,000 Estoril Open men's tennis tournament on Tuesday</p>
<p>(prefix numbers denote seeding):</p>
<p>Hicham Arazi (Morocco) beat Bernardo Mota (Portugal) 6-4 5-7</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Fabrice Santoro (France) beat Karol Kucera (Slovakia)  2-6 7-6</p>
<p>(7-1) 6-2</p>
<p>5-Alberto Berasategui (Spain) beat Carlos Costa (Spain) 3-6 6-2</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Christian Ruud (Norway) beat Karim Alami (Morocco) 6-3 6-1.</p>
<p>8-Javier Sanchez (Spain) beat Bruno Fragoso (Portugal) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Nuno Marques (Portugal) beat Alex Lopez-Moron (Spain) 7-5 6-2</p>
<p>2-Carlos Moya (Spain) beat Jacobo Diaz (Spain)  6-4 1-6 7-5</p>
<p>Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) beat Fernando Meligeni (Brazil) 6-4</p>
<p>6-2.</p>
</text>
